     "I managed to get include-what-you-use working; see<br><br><a href=\"http://code.google.com/p/include-what-you-use/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://code.google.com/p/include-what-you-use/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792477711078000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3CFnsAQs7IuoM23KLZiVUe\">http://code.google.com/p/include-what-you-use/</a><br><a href=\"http://www.llvm.org/devmtg/2010-11/Silverstein-IncludeWhatYouUse.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.llvm.org/devmtg/2010-11/Silverstein-IncludeWhatYouUse.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792477711078000&amp;usg=AOvVaw35KlmnyD0TB2JErPtkudyc\">http://www.llvm.org/devmtg/2010-11/Silverstein-IncludeWhatYouUse.pdf</a><br><br>In short, it is a clang-based tool that passes over the .cpp files and tells you if your #includes are suboptimal. It is mostly a For Google, By Google thing but they released it for other C++ projects. In particular, apparently Google has an internal law that every .cpp file must have a .hpp file with the same basename.<br><br><blockquote style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\" class=\"gmail_quote\">WARNING: include-what-you-use only analyzes .cc (or .cpp) files built by <tt>make</tt>,\r\n along with their corresponding .h files.  If your project has a .h file\r\n with no corresponding .cc file, iwyu will ignore it. \r\ninclude-what-you-use supports the <tt>AddGlobToReportIWYUViolationsFor()</tt> function which can be used to indicate other files to analyze, but it&#39;s not currently exposed to the user in any way. </blockquote><br>Anyway, here is what it does with the oxford model, for example (They have a python script that is supposed to make all these changes automagically, but I don&#39;t totally trust it yet)<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">oxford</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cpp should add these lines</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&lt;bits/mathcalls.h&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">             </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// for sqrt</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&lt;stddef.h&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">                     </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// for size_t</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&lt;algorithm&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">                    </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// for fill</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&lt;cmath&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">                        </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// for isnan, isfinite, fpclassify</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&lt;exception&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">                    </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// for exception</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&lt;ios&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">                          </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// for operator&amp;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&lt;iosfwd&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">                       </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// for ostream, stringstream, etc</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">                     </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// for cerr</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&lt;limits&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">                       </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// for numeric_limits</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&lt;memory&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">                       </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// for allocator</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&lt;new&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">                          </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// for operator new</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&lt;ostream&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">                      </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// for operator&lt;&lt;, basic_ostream, etc</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&lt;sstream&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">                      </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// for basic_stringstream</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&lt;stdexcept&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">                    </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// for domain_error, runtime_error</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&lt;string&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">                       </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// for string, operator+, etc</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&lt;vector&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">                       </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// for vector</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Eigen/src/Core/Map.h&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Eigen/src/Core/Matrix.h&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">      </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// for Matrix</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Eigen/src/Core/util/Constants.h&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// for Dynamic</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Eigen/src/Core/util/Memory.h&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// for first_aligned</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;boost/exception/diagnostic_information.hpp&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;boost/format/alt_sstream_impl.hpp&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;boost/format/format_implementation.hpp&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;boost/math/special_functions/fpclassify.hpp&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// for isfinite, etc</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;boost/optional/optional.hpp&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// for get_pointer</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;stan/agrad/agrad.hpp&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">         </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// for var, operator+, operator&lt;&lt;, etc</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;stan/agrad/matrix.hpp&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">        </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// for assign, initialize_variable</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;stan/agrad/special_functions.hpp&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// for inv_logit</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;stan/gm/command.hpp&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">          </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// for nuts_command</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;stan/io/csv_writer.hpp&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">       </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// for csv_writer</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;stan/io/reader.hpp&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">           </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// for reader</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;stan/io/var_context.hpp&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">      </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// for var_context</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;stan/io/writer.hpp&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">           </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// for writer</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;stan/math/error_handling.hpp&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// for check_greater_or_equal</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;stan/math/matrix.hpp&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">         </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// for get_base1, stan_print</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;stan/math/special_functions.hpp&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// for inv_logit</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"c